        "native_id": "x6tpvbmqw9j1",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "We are investigating delays in starting docker gen2 jobs that use dedicated IP ranges. Jobs are currently delayed by about 10 minutes.\n\nNo other resource classes are impacted at this time. We will continue to provide updates as more information is available.",
        "created_at": "2026-10-28T18:15:52.87Z"
      },
      {
        "native_id": "21hrh7mzv7ky",
        "status": "identified",
        "body": "We’ve identified the cause as limited compute availability from our cloud provider, and we are working to free up additional capacity for these jobs to restore normal start times. We'll provide another update again shortly.",
        "created_at": "2026-10-28T18:51:35.778Z"
      },
      {
        "native_id": "w1kq4tfpl13g",
        "status": "monitoring",
        "body": "We are starting to see signs of recovery now, wait times are starting to return to normal. We're keeping an eye on this and we'll update again soon.",
        "created_at": "2026-10-28T19:06:41.63Z"
      },
      {
        "native_id": "g6zyncfbvp1g",
        "status": "resolved",
        "body": "Wait times for gen2 dedicated IP range jobs have fully returned to normal. We appreciate your patience while worked through this issue.",
